DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
     The ttzzsseettuupp utility reads a database of timezone information and presents
     a menu allowing the user to select a specific zone without knowing the
     details of the database layout.  The selected zone is installed as the
     system default zone.  The ttzzsseettuupp utility also determines whether any ad‐
     justment is necessary for systems where the hardware clock does not keep
     UTC.

